---
/** Page title above the first roster card. */
---

<header class="roster-intro">
  <h1>Artistes</h1>
  <p>Afro-gospel and soul-fusion from Lagos.</p>
</header>

<style>
  .roster-intro {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .roster-intro h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }

  .roster-intro p {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
